# Tailwind CSS Conversion Project

## Project Status

This codebase is currently undergoing a systematic refactoring to convert all styling from CSS modules to Tailwind CSS utility classes. See [TAILWIND_CONVERSION_PROGRESS.md](mdc:TAILWIND_CONVERSION_PROGRESS.md) for detailed progress tracking.

## Conversion Guidelines

### When Converting Components

1. **Remove the CSS import** at the top of the file
2. **Replace all className attributes** with Tailwind utility classes
3. **Preserve exact visual appearance** - only the styling method changes
4. **Use standard Tailwind scale** - avoid arbitrary values unless absolutely necessary
5. **Test responsiveness** - ensure mobile, tablet, and desktop views work correctly
6. **Check for TypeScript errors** - fix any type issues that arise
7. **Use consistent patterns** - follow the examples in already-converted files

### Color System

Use the custom color palette defined in `tailwind.config.js`:

- **Primary Blue:** `rental-blue-{50-900}`
  - Example: `text-rental-blue-600` for #005cb3
- **Secondary Orange:** `rental-orange-{50-900}`  
  - Example: `bg-rental-orange-500` for #ff8c00

### Font Families

- `font-outfit` - Primary brand font (already imported globally)
- `font-inter` - Secondary font
- `font-montserrat` - Alternative font

### Common Tailwind Patterns

**Section Container:**
```tsx
<section className="px-6 md:px-10 lg:px-20 py-12 md:py-16">
  <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    {/* content */}
  </div>
</section>
```

**Card Component:**
```tsx
<div className="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
  {/* content */}
</div>
```

**Button:**
```tsx
<button className="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-rental-blue-600 text-white font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-rental-blue-700">
  Click Me
</button>
```

