1. Delete the corresponding `.css` file
2. Update any imports in `index.ts` files if needed
3. Run linter: `npm run lint`
4. Visually test the page in browser
5. Update [TAILWIND_CONVERSION_PROGRESS.md](mdc:TAILWIND_CONVERSION_PROGRESS.md)

## Global Layout Padding

After all pages are converted, ensure every page uses the `PageWrapper` component from `@/components/ui` for consistent horizontal padding. This replaces the old approach of defining padding per-page.

Example:
```tsx
import { PageWrapper } from '@/components/ui'

export default function MyPage() {
  return (
    <div>
      <Navbar />
      <PageWrapper>
        {/* page content gets automatic responsive padding */}
      </PageWrapper>
      <Footer />
    </div>
  )
}
```

